WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
|||||\\\\\\\\\\\\\

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Alchemy

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Shower

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:00.670
Is this alchemy of souls?

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:19.980
Is my soul moving now?

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:52.140
Project coordinator and editor: Ria_Lee

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:57.140
Assistant coordinators: Martini, gaarysn

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:02.140
Typesetter translators: Ria_Lee

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:09.340
The soul has not moved

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:12.260
What happened?

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:21.060
Chan Wook

00:03:22.110 --> 00:03:23.230
Chan Wook!

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:27.690
Chan Wook!

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:30.030
Chan Wook!

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:48.840
Kil Joo, you switched bodies with my student

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:51.720
Moo Deok

00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:58.020
I was weak to protect him from you

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:01.350
But I will definitely finish you off

00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:08.440
I didn't know

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:11.240
why were you so worried about Chan Wook?

00:04:11.990 --> 00:04:13.200
Shut up!

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:16.490
Teacher!

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:18.700
It's me, Chan Wook

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:20.870
We haven't changed

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:25.210
Look into my eyes

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:27.800
It's me

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:35.050
The only one who can look at you from such a distance

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:40.100
Do you recognize me?

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:04.020
He's got a mark on his shoulder

00:06:05.810 --> 00:06:08.690
His soul apparently returned back to his body

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:11.070
Then why am I okay?

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:12.110
Not really

00:06:12.820 --> 00:06:14.400
You have changed too. Look

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:17.910
You don't have a bracelet on, but your hand doesn't tremble

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:23.450
You're right. I can move it freely

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:25.910
The reflector helped gain energy

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:29.710
Poison opened your gates, reflect increased energy

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:34.090
Chan Wook, you are incredibly lucky

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:43.600
I'm sure I saw you there

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:45.640
What?

00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:07.290
Why?

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:09.790
Why are you okay?

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:12.840
You didn't succeed because of your weak energy.

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:15.050
You are also a nomad

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:16.970
Nak Soo you too

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:19.930
you will petrify and die

00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:23.050
Like me

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:25.890
Like your father

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:31.900
My father?

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:33.570
Yes

00:07:34.070 --> 00:07:36.900
Stargazer Mage

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:38.700
Cho Chun!

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:42.030
My father...

00:07:44.870 --> 00:07:46.290
was he a nomad?

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:53.670
It wasn't Daeho's main families who killed your family.

00:07:55.130 --> 00:07:59.260
It was your father. He turned into a soul swallower and killed everyone

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:03.390
Stay inside and don't go out

00:08:03.470 --> 00:08:06.390
If you see your father, run

00:08:06.470 --> 00:08:08.100
Don't let him catch you

00:08:11.480 --> 00:08:15.690
Both you and your father were used

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:18.780
You will turn to stone and die

00:08:19.740 --> 00:08:21.740
My father was a nomad

00:08:23.110 --> 00:08:24.280
did Dan Zhu?

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:27.370
Jin Moo from Jeonbugwan?

00:08:27.950 --> 00:08:30.910
Jin Moo is not the real Dan Joo

00:08:31.660 --> 00:08:34.540
True Dan Zhu is someone else

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:37.670
- And who is this?
- Real

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:41.340
can stop petrification

00:08:42.340 --> 00:08:45.510
Because he has an ice stone

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:47.850
Who is the real Dan Zhu?

00:09:12.620 --> 00:09:14.710
Moo Deok, are you okay?

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:17.170
Normal

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:19.960
Run after him. Faster!

00:09:56.710 --> 00:09:59.040
We need to get out of here

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:01.710
until the poison from witchcraft spread

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:27.320
View everything

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:28.660
- Yes
- Yes

00:10:52.260 --> 00:10:53.220
Nobody

00:10:58.810 --> 00:11:00.690
I felt the energy of witchcraft

00:11:00.770 --> 00:11:03.860
Master Huo was right. This sapsari is Gwigu

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:06.780
Did they really perform alchemy of souls here?

00:11:15.870 --> 00:11:16.790
What is this?

00:11:17.370 --> 00:11:18.750
Lying on the ground

00:11:19.870 --> 00:11:21.130
Maybe it's a reflector

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:28.130
This bracelet...

00:11:29.010 --> 00:11:31.010
Is this Mr. Chang Wook's bracelet?

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:32.760
Why is he here?

00:11:33.390 --> 00:11:34.970
So Uk was here?

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:40.980
They fought

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:43.230
Do you think something happened to him?

00:11:46.570 --> 00:11:49.110
Return to Sosnovy Bor and report what you saw

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:52.030
Dan Gu, come and look for Wook

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:54.030
- I'll look in the area
- Okay

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:32.410
How did the magicians of Sosnovy Bor find out?

00:12:49.550 --> 00:12:51.300
You are also a nomad

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:53.590
Nak Soo, you too

00:12:54.510 --> 00:12:56.720
you will petrify and die

00:12:56.800 --> 00:12:58.810
Like me

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:01.060
Like your father

00:13:04.770 --> 00:13:05.980
Father...

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:31.960
Both you and your father

00:13:33.670 --> 00:13:36.220
used. You'll turn to stone

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:39.810
and you will die

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:27.580
Why?

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:29.960
Why you again?

00:15:36.380 --> 00:15:39.220
Is this a nomad?

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:41.300
No, maid Uka

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:44.640
I accidentally wounded her, I need to take her to the doctors

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:54.070
What a day this is

00:15:54.150 --> 00:15:56.820
Trade was going well

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:05.080
I need to replenish my energy, otherwise I’ll completely petrify

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:09.790
-Have you finished?
- That's it already

00:16:10.370 --> 00:16:12.210
Shall we have a drink?

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:13.920
- Okay
- Faster

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:15.170
Let's go

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:19.130
I can't come back if I make a fuss

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:22.130
I need to find a quiet place where I can get enough

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:14.650
Move away

00:17:16.730 --> 00:17:17.980
Oh, oh, come on in

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:19.860
Mister

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:22.190
You won't fool us with these tricks

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:25.990
You've been following her since you entered the capital

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:35.830
This man is stalking us

00:17:39.590 --> 00:17:42.970
You followed her all the way to the inn

00:17:45.130 --> 00:17:47.430
We were just in one direction

00:17:47.510 --> 00:17:48.640
Don't lie

00:17:48.720 --> 00:17:51.520
You were staring at her the whole time!

00:17:51.600 --> 00:17:52.730
Not at all

00:17:52.810 --> 00:17:53.810
Song Yi

00:17:54.520 --> 00:17:56.190
Don't embarrass him

00:18:00.150 --> 00:18:03.570
I felt uncomfortable that you were following me, and it was also rude on your part

00:18:04.150 --> 00:18:07.110
If you don't want me to look for another inn,

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:08.320
go away

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:11.160
girl

00:18:11.990 --> 00:18:14.330
Why did you decide that I was following you?

00:18:14.910 --> 00:18:16.790
You don't owe me anything

00:18:16.870 --> 00:18:20.130
I don’t even know you, why should I follow you?

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:23.170
- Because she's very...
- Shut up, Sun Yi

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:26.340
Let her answer

00:18:28.510 --> 00:18:32.720
I had a lot of problems because of men who followed me because of my beauty

00:18:32.810 --> 00:18:33.970
So I decided

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:36.810
that you are one of them

00:18:37.390 --> 00:18:38.230
I see

00:18:39.150 --> 00:18:39.980
But that's not true

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:43.730
The beauty was not impressive

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:46.200
And I didn't follow you

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:49.200
Well then,

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:52.540
I'm sorry

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:54.540
Can I go up then?

00:19:07.050 --> 00:19:09.470
- Mrs. Ho
- Yes?

00:19:09.550 --> 00:19:11.180
you must eat

00:19:13.220 --> 00:19:14.390
This bastard...

00:19:15.350 --> 00:19:16.430
That is...

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:19.900
Are you embarrassed because you might cross paths with him again?

00:19:21.150 --> 00:19:22.440
No

00:19:23.400 --> 00:19:24.900
I just don't feel good

00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:27.240
Change into dry clothes

00:19:27.320 --> 00:19:29.740
I'll bring you some porridge

00:21:10.380 --> 00:21:11.590
Are you okay?

00:21:14.970 --> 00:21:17.720
What was that?

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:20.560
Have you been following him?

00:21:21.430 --> 00:21:22.600
Yes

00:21:24.480 --> 00:21:26.110
Glad you weren't hurt

00:21:26.940 --> 00:21:28.070
Wait a minute

00:21:29.730 --> 00:21:30.730
Thank you

00:21:31.240 --> 00:21:32.780
If you don't feel well,

00:21:33.570 --> 00:21:35.320
go to Sejukwon in Sosnovy Bor

00:21:35.410 --> 00:21:36.950
Do you know about Saejukwon?

00:21:37.030 --> 00:21:38.740
I'm from Saejukwon...

00:21:42.870 --> 00:21:44.580
I am Ho Young Ok

00:22:03.890 --> 00:22:06.980
Instead of a friend nearby, you have a whistle

00:22:08.230 --> 00:22:10.110
It means your friend left you

00:22:13.650 --> 00:22:14.900
Did you know

00:22:16.950 --> 00:22:18.450
who am I all this time

00:23:19.720 --> 00:23:20.970
Are you okay?

00:23:21.050 --> 00:23:22.760
Hey, how are you there?

00:23:22.850 --> 00:23:25.680
Try to get up. Slowly

00:23:29.270 --> 00:23:30.810
Monster!

00:23:32.900 --> 00:23:33.940
Soul swallower!

00:23:34.020 --> 00:23:35.110
It's a soul swallower!

00:23:35.190 --> 00:23:37.440
- Soul Swallower
- Soul swallower!

00:24:10.640 --> 00:24:13.440
True Dan Zhu is someone else

00:24:14.440 --> 00:24:18.110
The real one can stop petrification

00:24:18.190 --> 00:24:20.950
Yes, go to your Dan Zhu

00:24:23.240 --> 00:24:24.830
Is Kil Ju missing?

00:24:24.910 --> 00:24:28.660
We don't know where he is since he went after Chan Wook's maid

00:24:30.210 --> 00:24:31.790
Chan Wook's maid?

00:24:32.420 --> 00:24:34.170
Why does he need her?

00:24:34.250 --> 00:24:37.920
To be honest, he was following Chan Wook

00:24:38.960 --> 00:24:42.680
The spirit amulet that Nak Soo left behind belonged to Chan Wook

00:24:43.430 --> 00:24:46.560
He probably thought that Chan Wook was somehow related to her

00:24:46.640 --> 00:24:48.890
You should have told me earlier!

00:24:49.520 --> 00:24:50.770
He says to be silent

00:24:50.850 --> 00:24:53.150
Probably wanted to find hard evidence

00:24:53.770 --> 00:24:55.900
Tell all the mages to find Kil Ju

00:25:02.150 --> 00:25:03.820
Chan Wook's bracelet

00:25:03.910 --> 00:25:06.370
found where they performed the alchemy of souls?

00:25:06.450 --> 00:25:07.950
Dan Gu is looking for Mr.

00:25:08.040 --> 00:25:10.080
Master So inspects the surroundings of the temple

00:25:10.160 --> 00:25:12.790
- They were in the temple?
- Yes

00:25:12.870 --> 00:25:16.920
I doubt Uk is capable of alchemy

00:25:17.000 --> 00:25:18.340
Master Li,

00:25:18.420 --> 00:25:20.920
What if someone’s soul migrated into Uka’s body?

00:25:21.010 --> 00:25:23.760
Don't worry. I'm sure he's fine

00:25:28.390 --> 00:25:30.560
She will protect him

00:25:30.640 --> 00:25:31.810
Where is

00:25:31.890 --> 00:25:35.600
our leader, when is there such chaos here?

00:25:36.520 --> 00:25:38.230
Before Uk was born...

00:25:39.980 --> 00:25:42.030
20 years ago...

00:25:42.610 --> 00:25:43.610
Chang Gang

00:25:44.490 --> 00:25:46.320
performed alchemy of souls?

00:25:51.580 --> 00:25:53.830
Gwangju Jeonbugwan and witchcraft?

00:25:54.670 --> 00:25:56.000
This is just funny!

00:25:56.080 --> 00:25:57.290
Jin Moo told me about this

00:25:58.920 --> 00:26:00.960
I didn't dare ask him

00:26:02.380 --> 00:26:03.970
that's why I came to you

00:26:08.430 --> 00:26:09.810
Mrs. Do Hwa

00:26:11.060 --> 00:26:12.770
I was worried that Gwangju

00:26:13.770 --> 00:26:16.690
became interested in some strange spells

00:26:17.520 --> 00:26:20.820
But it didn't last long

00:26:21.400 --> 00:26:23.650
Gwangju hasn't been home for a year

00:26:24.280 --> 00:26:27.820
Trained spells with Jin Moo in Jeonbugwan's secret room

00:26:27.910 --> 00:26:28.870
But

00:26:28.950 --> 00:26:32.740
he stopped when his wife got pregnant

00:26:36.670 --> 00:26:40.540
He is the son of the deceased king

00:26:41.210 --> 00:26:42.300
King

00:26:43.090 --> 00:26:45.800
died due to illness without being able to move

00:26:45.880 --> 00:26:47.260
How is this possible?

00:26:49.220 --> 00:26:52.680
This is possible due to the alchemy of souls

00:26:54.640 --> 00:26:56.020
Being a magician

00:26:57.350 --> 00:26:59.520
he was burning with a simple interest in such things

00:26:59.600 --> 00:27:00.520
No

00:27:01.860 --> 00:27:03.150
He committed

00:27:04.650 --> 00:27:05.900
something irreparable

00:27:06.700 --> 00:27:10.700
with the lives of Do Hwa and Wook

00:27:21.000 --> 00:27:24.380
The magician from Jeonjingak is urgently looking for our master

00:27:34.180 --> 00:27:35.890
Didn't know you were here, uncle

00:27:35.970 --> 00:27:37.270
What is it?

00:27:38.440 --> 00:27:39.640
I think

00:27:40.480 --> 00:27:42.270
Uk fell victim to the alchemy of souls

00:27:43.360 --> 00:27:44.440
What?

00:28:08.840 --> 00:28:10.220
This is Jeonbugwan

00:28:10.760 --> 00:28:13.720
Is the real Dan Zhu behind these walls?

00:28:36.910 --> 00:28:39.500
This is the road to the palace

00:28:40.330 --> 00:28:43.170
Is the real Dan Zhu there?

00:28:52.970 --> 00:28:54.140
I'm from Jeonbugwan

00:28:54.850 --> 00:28:56.600
It's probably urgent

00:29:04.770 --> 00:29:06.020
Show your face

00:29:06.110 --> 00:29:08.020
It's urgent. Out of the way

00:29:08.110 --> 00:29:09.400
Show me your face first

00:29:31.920 --> 00:29:32.970
Soul Swallower

00:29:35.930 --> 00:29:37.050
Behind him

00:31:26.700 --> 00:31:28.790
Real in the palace

00:31:31.420 --> 00:31:32.750
Ice stone, right?

00:31:33.920 --> 00:31:35.460
You mentioned him

00:31:37.130 --> 00:31:40.260
I will find him and save her from a similar fate to you.

00:32:11.500 --> 00:32:12.920
Wait, he...

00:32:13.880 --> 00:32:15.250
Look

00:32:15.340 --> 00:32:16.880
Is he really dead?

00:32:16.960 --> 00:32:18.760
- Touch it
- Is it worth it?

00:32:36.860 --> 00:32:38.860
He tried to get into the palace until he turned to stone

00:32:40.740 --> 00:32:41.950
Did you kill him?

00:32:42.990 --> 00:32:44.450
How dare we?

00:32:44.530 --> 00:32:47.370
Suddenly some unknown magician appeared and killed him

00:32:48.120 --> 00:32:50.370
What family is he from? Have you seen the face?

00:32:50.450 --> 00:32:52.000
No, it was hidden

00:32:52.080 --> 00:32:54.750
But I saw what he used

00:33:01.210 --> 00:33:02.380
It was Tansu

00:33:05.840 --> 00:33:08.720
- Tansu?
- Yes, I'm sure

00:33:09.850 --> 00:33:11.390
He hit with energy from the sword

00:33:14.100 --> 00:33:17.190
Tansu was owned by Nak Su

00:33:17.270 --> 00:33:20.270
Was there someone else who mastered it?

00:33:29.330 --> 00:33:31.790
I heard you caught a soul swallower

00:33:32.450 --> 00:33:35.750
We came to see who it is

00:33:37.040 --> 00:33:39.960
Of course. You can look

00:34:03.860 --> 00:34:04.990
This is Kil Ju

00:34:05.860 --> 00:34:08.660
one of your people

00:34:10.580 --> 00:34:12.740
That's right

00:34:15.200 --> 00:34:17.830
Bring in the body and get everyone out

00:34:17.920 --> 00:34:18.790
Yes

00:34:24.420 --> 00:34:27.590
Jin Mu was with me when they performed alchemy

00:34:28.430 --> 00:34:30.010
He's confused too

00:34:31.010 --> 00:34:34.470
He didn't know they had done alchemy

00:34:36.180 --> 00:34:39.560
I'll take care of it since everything happened in Jeonbugwan.

00:34:39.650 --> 00:34:41.360
Has nothing to do with Sosnovy Bor

00:34:42.070 --> 00:34:43.150
Of course

00:34:43.900 --> 00:34:46.860
If necessary, we will provide assistance

00:34:47.450 --> 00:34:49.780
If necessary

00:34:52.370 --> 00:34:54.830
Another nomad turned into a souleater?

00:34:55.410 --> 00:34:58.540
Fortunately, he was caught and killed

00:34:58.620 --> 00:35:00.630
And who was it?

00:35:00.710 --> 00:35:01.920
Kil Ju,

00:35:02.000 --> 00:35:05.210
magician of Jeonbugwan

00:35:07.050 --> 00:35:09.180
Has Kil Ju become a nomad?

00:35:10.180 --> 00:35:13.260
Did Jeongbugwan catch him?

00:35:13.350 --> 00:35:15.350
He was caught in front of the palace

00:35:15.430 --> 00:35:18.480
He tried to get into the palace when he was running wild

00:35:19.440 --> 00:35:21.150
Did he come here?

00:35:21.230 --> 00:35:23.400
Suddenly a magician appeared

00:35:23.480 --> 00:35:25.610
who used Tansu

00:35:28.950 --> 00:35:30.990
And who was it?

00:35:32.530 --> 00:35:34.660
Kil Joo killed Nak Soo

00:35:34.740 --> 00:35:35.990
- What?
- Nak Soo?

00:35:36.080 --> 00:35:37.500
She's back!

00:35:37.580 --> 00:35:39.460
- Nak Soo?
- Mercenary?

00:35:40.000 --> 00:35:44.040
A magician wielding Tansu who appeared in front of the palace

00:35:44.130 --> 00:35:45.920
Nak Su owned it

00:35:46.000 --> 00:35:47.710
- Really?
- Amazing

00:35:47.800 --> 00:35:49.170
- Was it her?
- She?

00:35:49.260 --> 00:35:50.550
Wait a minute

00:35:50.630 --> 00:35:51.970
Nak Soo is dead

00:35:52.050 --> 00:35:52.930
Exactly!

00:35:53.010 --> 00:35:55.930
Everyone here saw her body burned.

00:35:56.010 --> 00:35:58.350
I saw it myself

00:35:58.430 --> 00:35:59.600
- Yes
- Exactly

00:35:59.680 --> 00:36:02.100
The body is burned, but the soul is alive

00:36:02.190 --> 00:36:05.570
The shadow warrior has become a nomad!

00:36:05.650 --> 00:36:07.320
- What?
- Is it true?

00:36:07.400 --> 00:36:09.320
- It can’t be
- Seriously?

00:36:09.400 --> 00:36:11.280
But Nak Soo is a girl

00:36:11.360 --> 00:36:13.410
And Kil Ju was killed by a young man

00:36:13.490 --> 00:36:16.660
Tall young man in blue robe

00:36:17.330 --> 00:36:19.330
Nak Su is a nomad, right?

00:36:19.410 --> 00:36:22.080
She could have migrated into the body of this young man

00:36:23.880 --> 00:36:25.790
And then I became stronger

00:36:27.300 --> 00:36:28.960
She was strong

00:36:29.050 --> 00:36:32.510
But in a man’s body she became even stronger

00:36:34.720 --> 00:36:36.140
Killing Kil Joo is her revenge

00:36:36.220 --> 00:36:38.680
Jeonbugwan for the burned body

00:36:39.350 --> 00:36:40.850
and killing her people

00:36:40.930 --> 00:36:42.350
Why should we take revenge?

00:36:42.440 --> 00:36:44.310
Pine Forest killed Nak Su

00:36:45.310 --> 00:36:50.070
"Dressed in blue, the incredible Nak Soo is back"

00:36:50.150 --> 00:36:52.740
"Pine Forest is her next goal"

00:36:52.820 --> 00:36:55.990
These are the rumors going around

00:36:56.070 --> 00:36:58.950
The soul swallower was caught just a couple of hours ago

00:36:59.040 --> 00:37:00.830
and already such absurd rumors?

00:37:01.410 --> 00:37:05.210
Rumors like these are as fast as wildfire.

00:37:05.290 --> 00:37:06.960
And the rumors are not groundless

00:37:07.040 --> 00:37:10.000
The magician used Tansa,

00:37:10.090 --> 00:37:12.470
like Nak Soo

00:37:12.550 --> 00:37:14.470
Was she the only one who owned it?

00:37:16.050 --> 00:37:18.760
I would like to, I’ve mastered it right now

00:37:20.560 --> 00:37:23.270
If these rumors spread throughout Sosnovy Bor,

00:37:23.350 --> 00:37:26.440
you will answer. Make sure this doesn't happen

00:37:27.230 --> 00:37:28.270
Yes

00:37:31.650 --> 00:37:34.650
What a blessing that you became a soul swallower

00:37:34.740 --> 00:37:36.160
not young master

00:37:37.070 --> 00:37:40.280
But why did we find his bracelet there?

00:37:41.950 --> 00:37:44.160
We'll find out when we find him

00:37:50.210 --> 00:37:52.760
You look bad

00:38:00.050 --> 00:38:01.390
You should

00:38:02.140 --> 00:38:04.480
go home and wait for him there

00:38:14.820 --> 00:38:16.530
Are you feeling unwell?

00:38:17.150 --> 00:38:20.200
I was so surprised that the honey cookies I ate yesterday

00:38:20.280 --> 00:38:22.290
still in my throat

00:38:24.330 --> 00:38:27.290
I was so scared when I heard about the soul swallower,

00:38:27.370 --> 00:38:29.710
that the soul first left the body and then returned

00:38:37.840 --> 00:38:40.260
Is it really back?

00:38:43.180 --> 00:38:44.520
Is that you, maid Kim?

00:38:45.350 --> 00:38:47.850
No, head. I'm Pak's maid

00:38:49.060 --> 00:38:52.690
I could have hit the young gentleman on the back, which scares me so much

00:38:54.780 --> 00:38:56.190
Hit me instead

00:38:58.570 --> 00:39:01.160
I give permission to Maid Pak

00:39:01.740 --> 00:39:02.830
Come on

00:39:02.910 --> 00:39:04.660
My hands are strong

00:39:04.740 --> 00:39:06.700
It will hurt

00:39:07.580 --> 00:39:09.790
I won't cry

00:39:09.870 --> 00:39:11.170
hit

00:39:14.800 --> 00:39:17.720
Consider that you've already hit me once

00:39:19.050 --> 00:39:20.340
Why?

00:39:21.050 --> 00:39:23.180
Will you do something unpleasant to me in return?

00:39:23.260 --> 00:39:25.770
Then I'll cancel this blow

00:39:25.850 --> 00:39:27.180
Hit me too

00:39:28.020 --> 00:39:29.140
Come on

00:39:30.100 --> 00:39:31.560
Hurry

00:39:37.230 --> 00:39:38.440
I...

00:39:40.200 --> 00:39:41.860
I don't want to hurt you

00:39:44.240 --> 00:39:46.200
As the head of Sosnovy Bor,

00:39:47.450 --> 00:39:50.410
I'll have to act cold and heartless

00:39:51.080 --> 00:39:52.420
But I really

00:39:53.540 --> 00:39:55.210
I don't want to hurt you

00:40:00.880 --> 00:40:02.220
Are you worried about

00:40:02.760 --> 00:40:06.220
What did they ask me yesterday about Master Chang Gan?

00:40:06.810 --> 00:40:08.770
A lot has happened

00:40:08.850 --> 00:40:10.850
Being the head, I couldn't

00:40:11.850 --> 00:40:13.810
be objective

00:40:14.770 --> 00:40:16.900
Your blow brought me to my senses

00:40:17.730 --> 00:40:20.950
Now we must act wisely

00:40:25.120 --> 00:40:27.030
Feel free to hit me

00:40:28.370 --> 00:40:29.950
as Pak's maid

00:40:31.870 --> 00:40:33.040
From you

00:40:34.040 --> 00:40:35.630
I'll accept

00:40:51.810 --> 00:40:53.140
Why are you here?

00:40:53.230 --> 00:40:55.770
Master Ho said to find out where the witchcraft is coming from

00:40:55.860 --> 00:40:58.150
And on the spot I found this

00:40:59.150 --> 00:41:01.280
Apparently lost

00:41:02.700 --> 00:41:04.240
Don't you need him anymore?

00:41:05.280 --> 00:41:07.070
No, not anymore

00:41:07.780 --> 00:41:10.240
Almost lost the Jin family's treasure

00:41:11.330 --> 00:41:12.580
Thanks for finding it

00:41:14.000 --> 00:41:15.710
You've lost something else

00:41:17.000 --> 00:41:18.840
Aren't you going to look for Moo Deok?

00:41:20.880 --> 00:41:21.920
Where is she?

00:41:23.670 --> 00:41:25.300
I found her when she was hiding in the forest

00:41:26.760 --> 00:41:29.680
She was wounded and bleeding

00:41:44.990 --> 00:41:45.910
Moo Deok

00:41:47.620 --> 00:41:48.780
owner,

00:41:49.330 --> 00:41:51.790
how could you leave me?

00:41:51.870 --> 00:41:52.870
What?

00:41:54.620 --> 00:41:58.080
You ran away leaving me

00:41:58.920 --> 00:42:00.420
Play along with me

00:42:04.130 --> 00:42:07.220
Yes... I ran away

00:42:07.800 --> 00:42:08.760
Exactly!

00:42:08.840 --> 00:42:12.140
We encountered a soul swallower while hiding from the rain

00:42:12.220 --> 00:42:13.520
Thanks to you

00:42:13.600 --> 00:42:16.890
This soul eater almost ate me

00:42:19.400 --> 00:42:20.440
I'm sorry

00:42:22.020 --> 00:42:25.740
I was so scared that I couldn't think about anything, and I ran away

00:42:27.320 --> 00:42:30.700
Yul mistook Moo Deok for a soul swallower and almost killed him

00:42:31.370 --> 00:42:34.410
If he hadn't taken care of her properly, Moo Deok would have died.

00:42:39.960 --> 00:42:41.420
Yul,

00:42:41.500 --> 00:42:45.420
thank you for saving Moo Deok and taking care of her

00:42:51.300 --> 00:42:53.100
Did you really run away and leave her?

00:42:58.890 --> 00:43:00.730
Otherwise I would die

00:43:01.360 --> 00:43:02.820
Sometimes you only have to think about yourself

00:43:04.320 --> 00:43:06.400
What are you looking at? Don't agree?

00:43:07.780 --> 00:43:10.030
In any case, I'm glad

00:43:10.110 --> 00:43:12.830
that we're both fine

00:43:22.420 --> 00:43:23.250
Yes

00:43:29.550 --> 00:43:31.390
I heard you were hiding in Danhyangok

00:43:31.970 --> 00:43:33.850
Did you hear what our leader said?

00:43:33.930 --> 00:43:36.060
Sosnovy Bor will take your shame upon itself

00:43:36.140 --> 00:43:37.640
I'm so tired of it

00:43:38.390 --> 00:43:40.810
Why, if I’m not even a member of Sosnovy Bor?

00:43:40.890 --> 00:43:43.020
Duel with the prince in two weeks

00:43:43.650 --> 00:43:47.230
Stay out of town until then, don't cause problems.

00:43:47.320 --> 00:43:48.530
Keep your head down

00:43:54.530 --> 00:43:56.790
Thank you for taking care of me

00:43:56.870 --> 00:43:58.950
Apparently, Uk copes well without a bracelet

00:44:00.040 --> 00:44:02.250
I think he can control the energy now

00:44:04.540 --> 00:44:07.420
He risked his life again and got what he wanted

00:44:07.500 --> 00:44:09.010
And you were there again

00:44:11.800 --> 00:44:15.600
If you cared that much, you would have left me to die.

00:44:16.220 --> 00:44:17.350
Maybe

00:44:19.100 --> 00:44:20.480
next time

00:44:27.360 --> 00:44:28.570
Moo Deok

00:44:29.650 --> 00:44:30.900
I'm coming, master

00:44:33.660 --> 00:44:34.700
We went

00:44:40.580 --> 00:44:42.620
Uk was not injured

00:44:43.540 --> 00:44:44.460
That's good

00:44:45.380 --> 00:44:47.290
He saw

00:44:47.380 --> 00:44:49.880
who was with Kil-ju when he changed souls?

00:44:49.960 --> 00:44:52.880
Probably the guy in blue

00:44:52.970 --> 00:44:55.390
Wook was too busy running to look

00:44:55.470 --> 00:44:57.180
Did you ask his maid?

00:44:58.600 --> 00:45:00.350
She must have seen the spells

00:45:03.350 --> 00:45:04.600
Moo Deok...

00:45:10.610 --> 00:45:12.780
If she saw it, she hardly knows what it is

00:45:13.990 --> 00:45:16.740
This is an ordinary maid who knows little about magic

00:45:19.410 --> 00:45:21.580
What about the hand?

00:45:23.330 --> 00:45:24.160
Got hurt?

00:45:26.710 --> 00:45:29.750
The reflector I touched still contains poison from witchcraft.

00:45:30.590 --> 00:45:31.670
But I'm fine

00:45:33.340 --> 00:45:34.720
I'll go

00:46:12.840 --> 00:46:14.670
Why did you want to see me?

00:46:16.550 --> 00:46:20.760
I heard you took my wedding gifts

00:46:21.390 --> 00:46:22.720
Why?

00:46:22.810 --> 00:46:25.930
Were you afraid that I would destroy them?

00:46:26.020 --> 00:46:30.020
I'll save them for your next wedding

00:46:30.560 --> 00:46:31.980
Throw them away

00:46:32.070 --> 00:46:34.400
Marriage is no longer my priority

00:46:35.400 --> 00:46:37.530
Don't be so embarrassed

00:46:37.610 --> 00:46:42.120
The wedding was prepared secretly, few people knew about it

00:46:44.160 --> 00:46:45.120
Really?

00:46:47.370 --> 00:46:49.500
Cho Young!

00:46:53.130 --> 00:46:54.880
They say you're getting married

00:46:55.670 --> 00:46:58.800
I heard about gifts, and that I found a craftsman to make rings

00:46:59.340 --> 00:47:02.100
Apparently the rumors have spread

00:47:02.180 --> 00:47:03.100
Congratulations

00:47:03.180 --> 00:47:05.430
Congratulations, Young Master Park

00:47:06.100 --> 00:47:08.770
- Me?
- I know that you are getting married

00:47:08.850 --> 00:47:10.690
He received gifts

00:47:10.770 --> 00:47:12.610
I went with you to try on rings

00:47:12.690 --> 00:47:13.820
Really?

00:47:13.900 --> 00:47:16.740
There were absurd rumors that you were marrying Chan Wook

00:47:17.320 --> 00:47:18.280
No?

00:47:18.360 --> 00:47:20.030
It's you two getting married

00:47:21.700 --> 00:47:22.740
Yes, that's right

00:47:22.820 --> 00:47:24.740
But don't talk about it

00:47:24.830 --> 00:47:26.250
Still a secret

00:47:26.870 --> 00:47:28.000
Okay

00:47:28.620 --> 00:47:29.790
See you

00:47:31.040 --> 00:47:33.420
I told you it's Dan Gu

00:47:33.500 --> 00:47:36.590
Exactly. She's not crazy to marry Uka again

00:47:36.670 --> 00:47:38.260
Don't tell

00:47:40.930 --> 00:47:42.010
Dan Gu

00:47:42.090 --> 00:47:43.890
Why did you confirm their words?

00:47:44.470 --> 00:47:46.770
It's better than admitting that Wook rejected you twice

00:47:47.390 --> 00:47:50.190
Let's say that this time you refused to marry me

00:47:50.270 --> 00:47:52.060
It will still be just rumors

00:47:53.690 --> 00:47:55.980
Do you agree to this arrangement?

00:47:56.940 --> 00:47:58.490
You'll be embarrassed

00:47:59.740 --> 00:48:00.950
I agree

00:48:28.930 --> 00:48:29.890
Won Moo Deok?

00:48:31.480 --> 00:48:33.940
Are you back here again? Weren't you hurt?

00:48:34.940 --> 00:48:35.940
What?

00:48:38.860 --> 00:48:40.400
Forget. Move away

00:48:45.530 --> 00:48:47.700
Looking for Moo Deok again?

00:48:47.780 --> 00:48:50.540
No. The dress just looked familiar

00:48:51.870 --> 00:48:54.330
Moo Deok sold it to us

00:48:55.080 --> 00:48:57.090
- Did you sell it?
- Yes

00:48:57.170 --> 00:49:00.090
She said it was a gift from a frivolous man

00:49:00.170 --> 00:49:01.590
And also that he is well off

00:49:01.670 --> 00:49:03.630
and won't ask for the dress back

00:49:05.260 --> 00:49:07.890
Did she really say that?

00:49:07.970 --> 00:49:11.770
Yes. Stink Moo Deok and silk can't go hand in hand

00:49:12.730 --> 00:49:13.980
Watch your language

00:49:14.730 --> 00:49:15.600
What?

00:49:15.690 --> 00:49:19.070
I gave her this name and only I can call her that

00:49:19.150 --> 00:49:20.280
Not you

00:49:21.230 --> 00:49:22.280
Sorry

00:49:23.990 --> 00:49:25.070
And also

00:49:27.160 --> 00:49:29.450
she looked good in that dress

00:49:30.160 --> 00:49:32.540
Better than you in that blue cape

00:49:33.120 --> 00:49:34.790
Apparently you don't like it

00:49:36.380 --> 00:49:37.630
What is this?

00:49:37.710 --> 00:49:40.340
Everyone here is like this

00:49:40.420 --> 00:49:42.460
This is Nak Soo's robe

00:49:42.550 --> 00:49:43.590
Whose?

00:49:43.670 --> 00:49:47.050
Nomad Nak Su killed the magician Jeonbugwan in front of the palace

00:49:47.640 --> 00:49:49.810
She was wearing a similar robe

00:49:49.890 --> 00:49:53.520
Now everyone in the capital has this

00:49:59.060 --> 00:50:02.320
- Come, buy Nak Su’s robe
- I have one

00:50:02.400 --> 00:50:04.150
It will protect your soul from being consumed

00:50:04.240 --> 00:50:05.650
- This one
- Take

00:50:05.740 --> 00:50:08.160
I need this one

00:50:08.240 --> 00:50:10.450
- Nak Su's Cape
- Try it on

00:50:15.120 --> 00:50:17.210
Nomad in Blue

00:50:18.330 --> 00:50:20.590
Everyone thinks Nak Soo is back from the dead

00:50:22.300 --> 00:50:26.130
But thanks to "Nak Soo in Blue",

00:50:26.220 --> 00:50:28.890
no one remembers the fight between Uka and the prince

00:50:30.050 --> 00:50:32.010
I wonder where Wook and Moo Deok are

00:50:33.140 --> 00:50:34.520
They weren't in Danhyangok

00:50:35.390 --> 00:50:36.850
I'm sure they're fine

00:50:37.560 --> 00:50:40.190
They'll be back in two weeks

00:50:42.650 --> 00:50:44.280
By the way, Yul

00:50:46.860 --> 00:50:48.570
I bought it for myself too. Do you want to try it on?

00:50:54.290 --> 00:50:55.250
Okay

00:50:59.830 --> 00:51:02.380
Who could it be?

00:51:02.460 --> 00:51:05.630
Nak Soo in blue, wielding Tansu?

00:51:13.640 --> 00:51:15.770
You said this was the grave of the soulswallowers

00:51:17.350 --> 00:51:18.940
So he must be here

00:51:20.810 --> 00:51:21.940
Your father

00:51:23.900 --> 00:51:25.480
Baby

00:51:26.030 --> 00:51:29.780
I thought he was killed by the magicians of the four families

00:51:31.490 --> 00:51:34.120
Jin Mu took me in, I called him Dan Zhu

00:51:34.200 --> 00:51:35.240
But...

00:51:36.870 --> 00:51:39.370
my father was a nomad, he was used

00:51:41.080 --> 00:51:43.380
And I was used, then abandoned

00:51:46.960 --> 00:51:48.510
As Kil Joo said,

00:51:49.630 --> 00:51:51.380
I will petrify and die

00:51:56.220 --> 00:51:57.640
When I'm petrified

00:52:02.060 --> 00:52:03.730
will you bury me here?

00:52:15.240 --> 00:52:19.330
I found out where the real Dan Zhu is

00:52:21.000 --> 00:52:24.040
In the palace. The real one is there

00:52:28.510 --> 00:52:31.380
Tell me about the ice stone

00:52:33.050 --> 00:52:34.340
Are you sure

00:52:34.930 --> 00:52:38.180
that he was destroyed

00:52:39.560 --> 00:52:43.270
by Master Seo Kyung and the head of Jinyeowon 200 years ago?

00:52:46.060 --> 00:52:47.650
We are sure that he

00:52:49.230 --> 00:52:50.690
not in Sosnovy Bor

00:53:11.880 --> 00:53:13.800
Hello Dan Zhu

00:53:30.110 --> 00:53:33.780
Kil Ju wanted an ice stone, so he came to the palace to see me

00:53:34.950 --> 00:53:36.110
I didn't know

00:53:37.070 --> 00:53:39.580
that Kil Joo knows who the real Dan Joo is

00:53:40.290 --> 00:53:42.200
The day the Choi family regains power

00:53:42.830 --> 00:53:46.750
and Sosnovy Bor, the cause of our fall, was destroyed

00:53:48.750 --> 00:53:51.960
It's already very close. Then I will begin to rule in Daeho

00:53:53.720 --> 00:53:56.260
I look forward to this day no less than you

00:53:57.680 --> 00:54:01.100
We must find and kill the one who dealt with Kil Ju

00:54:02.600 --> 00:54:05.060
This man must have been waiting for Kil Joo

00:54:05.140 --> 00:54:07.900
will come to the palace for the stone

00:54:07.980 --> 00:54:10.570
If he knows where the stone is,

00:54:11.070 --> 00:54:12.440
you have to find

00:54:13.570 --> 00:54:14.860
and kill him

00:54:19.450 --> 00:54:20.910
I don't know who it is

00:54:21.950 --> 00:54:23.910
but the real Dan Zhu is in the palace and he has a stone

00:54:24.000 --> 00:54:26.710
With its help, nomads do not turn into soulswallowers

00:54:28.790 --> 00:54:32.050
So, we need to get into the palace and find Dan Zhu?

00:54:32.130 --> 00:54:34.130
It's impossible now

00:54:34.920 --> 00:54:37.380
I am a weak magician rejected by Jeongjingak

00:54:38.010 --> 00:54:40.600
But I will climb forward

00:54:41.720 --> 00:54:44.220
And I will definitely get to the palace

00:54:45.810 --> 00:54:46.850
teacher,

00:54:48.100 --> 00:54:49.350
I'll find

00:54:50.400 --> 00:54:51.770
stone for you

00:54:57.280 --> 00:54:58.320
Chan Wook

00:54:59.200 --> 00:55:01.530
Your teacher is not strong enough to pull you up

00:55:02.620 --> 00:55:05.290
or cover from behind

00:55:06.960 --> 00:55:10.130
You've never been like this

00:55:10.670 --> 00:55:12.250
Always pushed me to death

00:55:15.760 --> 00:55:19.680
But after each time I became better and stronger than I was

00:55:23.470 --> 00:55:25.310
Keep putting me in danger

00:55:25.890 --> 00:55:27.520
The main thing is to be close

00:55:37.490 --> 00:55:38.700
Okay

00:55:39.650 --> 00:55:41.780
I'll be there and push you to death,

00:55:41.870 --> 00:55:44.200
if you stop

00:56:11.730 --> 00:56:14.810
I'll find Uka and make sure he doesn't show up for the fight.

00:56:16.650 --> 00:56:17.940
No need

00:56:18.490 --> 00:56:20.820
If he wants to come,

00:56:21.700 --> 00:56:22.660
let him

00:56:22.740 --> 00:56:25.410
This is an official duel between magicians

00:56:26.160 --> 00:56:28.370
We won't be able to intervene even if one dies.

00:56:30.500 --> 00:56:32.250
If someone dies

00:56:34.210 --> 00:56:35.710
so that's how it will be

00:56:40.130 --> 00:56:41.670
Won't you stop this?

00:56:45.640 --> 00:56:48.310
The unified council demanded from Uka

00:56:48.390 --> 00:56:50.480
fight on behalf of Sosnovy Bor

00:56:51.390 --> 00:56:53.310
Run away from cowardly

00:56:54.020 --> 00:56:56.110
and will die with honor,

00:56:56.900 --> 00:57:01.780
I will just watch how the head of Sosnovy Bor

00:58:33.910 --> 00:58:38.210
Their Lordships the King and Queen have arrived

00:59:11.280 --> 00:59:14.080
A month ago, Go Won, heir to the Daeho royal family,

00:59:14.160 --> 00:59:17.710
challenged the eldest son of the Chan family to a duel

00:59:17.790 --> 00:59:21.330
Sosnovy Bor accepted the challenge on behalf of Chan Wook

00:59:22.130 --> 00:59:24.170
By signing this document,

00:59:24.250 --> 00:59:26.460
you undertake not to make any claims

00:59:27.420 --> 00:59:30.470
even in the event of someone's death

00:59:32.180 --> 00:59:35.970
The match will begin at noon

00:59:36.640 --> 00:59:38.730
If Chang Wook doesn't show up by then,

00:59:39.520 --> 00:59:41.520
we'll take this as defeat

00:59:44.230 --> 00:59:49.240
You should mention the punishment he will receive if he doesn't show up

00:59:52.530 --> 00:59:57.120
If Chang Wook doesn't come today,

00:59:57.910 --> 01:00:02.000
he will lose the right to become the next Gwangju

01:00:03.920 --> 01:00:05.340
Jeonbugwana

01:00:26.440 --> 01:00:27.360
To me

01:00:29.110 --> 01:00:30.950
What's in those jugs?

01:00:32.740 --> 01:00:34.410
Water

01:00:34.990 --> 01:00:36.530
Water?

01:01:09.230 --> 01:01:11.190
Chapter, it's already noon

01:01:11.280 --> 01:01:13.240
Close the hall door

01:01:14.450 --> 01:01:15.620
I have to

01:01:16.870 --> 01:01:18.370
announce his loss

01:01:38.430 --> 01:01:39.350
Close

01:01:54.400 --> 01:01:55.660
Chan Wook has arrived!

01:02:05.000 --> 01:02:05.920
Mister...

01:02:36.610 --> 01:02:37.610
Mister

01:02:39.200 --> 01:02:40.200
Everything will be fine

01:02:44.750 --> 01:02:47.080
Chan Wook

01:03:07.390 --> 01:03:09.350
You signed the paper

01:03:09.440 --> 01:03:10.940
Now no one will interfere

01:03:11.690 --> 01:03:13.690
even if you die during the fight

01:03:14.900 --> 01:03:16.070
Got it

01:03:19.780 --> 01:03:20.990
Mother,

01:03:21.070 --> 01:03:23.700
stop this fight

01:03:24.450 --> 01:03:27.250
He will die by the hand of the Crown Prince

01:03:27.330 --> 01:03:29.330
He came because he was ready to die

01:03:30.420 --> 01:03:32.130
Your marriage is annulled again

01:03:32.210 --> 01:03:34.960
His fate has nothing to do with us

01:03:48.480 --> 01:03:49.850
You can start

01:04:19.050 --> 01:04:21.260
First: don't attack, just defend

01:04:21.340 --> 01:04:23.510
You attack him with your skills -

01:04:25.050 --> 01:04:26.220
you'll die

01:04:28.140 --> 01:04:30.060
You can only attack when he

01:04:31.230 --> 01:04:32.810
will lose concentration

01:05:10.850 --> 01:05:12.810
I'm sure he arranged them

01:05:12.890 --> 01:05:15.610
Can you really go to Sosnovy Bor whenever you want?

01:05:16.650 --> 01:05:17.820
Yes. And what?

01:05:18.860 --> 01:05:20.400
I have a favor to ask

01:05:20.990 --> 01:05:22.820
You can place water in the training room,

01:05:22.900 --> 01:05:24.990
so he can use Tansu?

01:05:39.170 --> 01:05:42.170
These water jugs confuse me

01:05:43.880 --> 01:05:44.840
Break them down

01:06:44.650 --> 01:06:45.700
Owner

01:06:57.370 --> 01:06:58.500
Tansu

01:07:16.430 --> 01:07:17.390
Prince...

01:07:17.480 --> 01:07:18.560
Duel

01:07:19.100 --> 01:07:20.270
finished

01:07:25.320 --> 01:07:27.650
Not fair. Doesn't count!

01:07:37.500 --> 01:07:39.040
It was Tansu

01:07:39.960 --> 01:07:42.920
It can only be mastered by those who have mastered Chisa

01:07:43.790 --> 01:07:47.550
How could Chang Wook, whose gate was only recently opened, take possession of him?

01:07:47.630 --> 01:07:48.970
I'm sure

01:07:49.050 --> 01:07:52.300
that one of the masters helped him

01:07:52.390 --> 01:07:55.510
How would they help him?

01:07:55.600 --> 01:07:57.430
if everyone was watching?

01:07:57.520 --> 01:07:58.980
Don't talk nonsense!

01:07:59.600 --> 01:08:01.560
Chan Wook, answer

01:08:01.650 --> 01:08:04.190
You really mastered Chisa and then Tansa

01:08:04.270 --> 01:08:05.980
in such a short time?

01:08:07.530 --> 01:08:08.860
Not really

01:08:09.780 --> 01:08:11.780
I have trouble controlling my energy

01:08:11.860 --> 01:08:14.120
I can only use Tansa if there is water.

01:08:14.700 --> 01:08:17.410
I only know how to cut water

01:08:17.500 --> 01:08:19.790
Who taught you this?

01:08:21.580 --> 01:08:23.790
Someone should have helped you

01:08:26.960 --> 01:08:28.010
Nobody

01:08:29.920 --> 01:08:30.970
You look

01:08:31.680 --> 01:08:33.140
This is just funny

01:08:33.220 --> 01:08:35.760
Claims to have mastered this skill himself

01:08:38.850 --> 01:08:41.440
I noticed jugs of water here

01:08:43.150 --> 01:08:45.190
Who installed them?

01:08:46.860 --> 01:08:48.690
Your teacher?

01:08:50.570 --> 01:08:52.030
I studied on my own

01:08:52.110 --> 01:08:53.490
I won't fall for this!

01:08:53.570 --> 01:08:55.450
Chan Wook, explain yourself

01:08:58.910 --> 01:09:02.040
Who helped you train?

01:09:12.170 --> 01:09:13.260
I put the jugs

01:09:25.900 --> 01:09:27.480
And I was with him

01:09:28.270 --> 01:09:31.440
Everything he said is true

01:09:35.110 --> 01:09:36.280
Who are you?

01:09:37.200 --> 01:09:39.120
How dare you interfere?

01:09:39.200 --> 01:09:40.290
Shut up!

01:09:41.040 --> 01:09:43.710
This is Hemp Master Li

01:09:43.790 --> 01:09:45.500
Master So Kyung's student

01:09:45.580 --> 01:09:47.420
Say hello to him!

01:09:50.800 --> 01:09:52.630
Hello master

01:09:55.470 --> 01:09:58.890
I was with him in Danhyangok and saw everything

01:09:58.970 --> 01:10:01.680
He learned to chop drops of water for days on end.

01:10:04.890 --> 01:10:06.440
And with him

01:10:07.940 --> 01:10:10.320
there was only his maid

01:10:12.360 --> 01:10:15.400
Master Li vouched for him

01:10:17.450 --> 01:10:21.910
Are there any other objections?

01:10:56.860 --> 01:10:58.490
Let's go, Your Majesty

01:11:15.590 --> 01:11:18.340
Let Chan Wook enter Jeonbugwan

01:11:31.480 --> 01:11:34.900
No wonder Gwangju Chang Gang's son is so talented

01:11:34.980 --> 01:11:40.030
Since you don't have a teacher yet, Jeonbugwan will gladly accept you

01:11:40.820 --> 01:11:42.700
I don't need it here!

01:11:42.780 --> 01:11:45.120
I should be his teacher

01:11:45.200 --> 01:11:48.330
I opened his gates, and it was I who gave him my energy

01:11:48.410 --> 01:11:50.830
Wook, come with me to Sejukwon

01:11:50.920 --> 01:11:53.210
I'll teach you everything I know

01:11:53.290 --> 01:11:55.550
Or maybe to Jinyeowon?

01:11:57.300 --> 01:11:59.130
Engagement with Cho Young is broken,

01:11:59.220 --> 01:12:02.470
but we will consider you family and teach you our spells

01:12:06.930 --> 01:12:08.140
Chan Wook,

01:12:09.020 --> 01:12:11.270
if you want, you can join Jeonjingak

01:12:12.980 --> 01:12:14.270
We will accept you

01:12:33.460 --> 01:12:34.590
Moo Deok,

01:12:34.670 --> 01:12:38.420
Everyone calls me. Where to go?

01:12:50.890 --> 01:12:52.690
Enter Sosnovy Bor,

01:12:53.560 --> 01:12:54.690
owner

01:13:04.700 --> 01:13:06.780
I, Chan Wook, the eldest son of the Chan family,

01:13:07.580 --> 01:13:09.660
I will enter Jeonjingak

01:13:49.430 --> 01:14:00.740
Thanks for watching with us!

01:14:01.740 --> 01:14:04.700
Alchemy

01:14:01.740 --> 01:14:04.700
Shower

01:14:06.790 --> 01:14:09.920
The master became the magician of Jeonjingak

01:14:10.010 --> 01:14:13.220
Welcome our new magician Chan Wook

01:14:13.880 --> 01:14:16.050
I hate your master until I grind my teeth

01:14:16.140 --> 01:14:17.050
Of course

01:14:19.810 --> 01:14:22.060
If this love is so fickle, then I don’t need it!

01:14:22.140 --> 01:14:23.100
Let me in

01:14:23.190 --> 01:14:24.020
Moo Deok

01:14:24.100 --> 01:14:26.440
I should be with the owner

01:14:26.520 --> 01:14:27.650
Go home, wait there

01:14:27.730 --> 01:14:30.070
Mister Chan got out and went home

01:14:30.820 --> 01:14:32.700
Master! Wait there

01:14:32.780 --> 01:14:34.950
- I'm coming to you
- I found questions for the exam

01:14:35.610 --> 01:14:36.870
Whatever happens

01:14:36.950 --> 01:14:39.370
I will go to Sosnovy Bor to the owner

01:14:39.450 --> 01:14:40.660
Moo Deok

01:14:40.740 --> 01:14:43.750
I can handle anything just to see you
